you would have stuff randomly happening at the discretion of the
viewer.

Some effects that could be chosen would be positive.  These would be:

-One item gets randomly uncursed, if cursed, or blessed, if uncursed.
Basically, a random letter is chosen, and if there is an item there,
it recieves the effect.
-Player is invulnerable for a certain amount of time, ignoring all
attacks (like you do when you are praying successfully)
-Player is healed for a certain amount of health.
-Player recieves a package, when opened by applying it, it gives the
player a random item.
Some assists would send funny messages to the player.
Others would be very bad.
